{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/2575-a-basic-idea-for-a-game-set-in-modern-day-berlin","id":2575,"title":"A basic idea for a game set in modern day Berlin.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-04T07:02:08-08:00","id":2575,"title":"A basic idea for a game set in modern day Berlin.","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">I always find it hard to start these kinda posts so I might just hop straight in there with an idea I have, and see what people think really.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">I'm going to start writing a Changeling: The Lost game set in modern day Berlin. The basic premise being that for Changelings, the Berlin Wall never fell. For the local hedge houses a giant, long wall blocking the Berlin freehold from Arcadia and vice-versa.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">A lot of the changelings who are recently escaping by finding cracks and holes in the wall, or somehow climbing over it, were kidnapped during a time when the wall still stood, only to come back to Berlin and find the Berlin Wall is long gone, and are finding it hard to shake their Cold War views in a post Cold War world</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">The two major plot themes I have at the moment is either revolt, as a lot of freshly escaped Changelings are angry at the local freehold for not destroying the hedge wall. The second theme is going to play on the weight of having to make a choice. Do you destroy the hedge wall, knowing that the wall is stopping the True Fae from storming Berlin, or do refuse to destroy the wall, knowing you're trapping many changelings in Arcadia?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">This is the basic idea, I still need to work on it before I start researching into things.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":652,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/652-jay-stewart","user":"Jay Stewart","date":".  because I suck at writing 11-04-2013, 10:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/652-jay-stewart","name":"Jay Stewart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar652_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T07:18:05-08:00","id":2592,"title":"","content":"Ever watched <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodbye_lenin\" target=\"_blank\">Goodbye Lenin</a>? It's good inspiration for the newly-returned. How to deal with the changes, or ignore them as much as possible for your own/your loved one's sanity - or because of your own insanity.<br /> Also <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monster_(manga)\" target=\"_blank\">Monster</a> can probably give you ideas for less realistic aspects, such as True Fae, Durances, low-Clarity Changelings, and NPC in general. There are plot elements and themes that would mesh well with Changeling, too: forgotten/fake names, (horrifying) child books, deals made without your knowledge, alienation, paranoia, insanity. Starts before the fall of the Wall, and truly takes off afterwards; social changes are also talked about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T07:23:05-08:00","id":2598,"title":"","content":"I'm definitely going to go and check these out when I can, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/652-jay-stewart","name":"Jay Stewart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar652_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}